{"id":"claim:negation/negation-polarity-items-scope--particle-ka-frequent-in-negative-contexts","revision":1,"topic":"topic:negation/negation-polarity-items-scope","topics":["topic:negation/negation-polarity-items-scope","topic:negation/negation-polarity-items-scope--ka"],"statement":{"en":"The particle ka is frequently used in negative clauses or with verbs of negative meaning, but is not strictly required.","ja":"助詞 ka は否定文や否定的な意味の動詞を含む節でよく用いられるが、必須ではない。"},"type":"distribution","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"frequently","modality":"assertive","conditions":["negative clause or verb of negative meaning"]},"forms":["ka"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:nakagawa2024@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0320-03","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:negation/negation-polarity-items-scope--particle-ka-frequency-and-scalar-meaning-shizunai","revision":1,"topic":"topic:negation/negation-polarity-items-scope","topics":["topic:negation/negation-polarity-items-scope","topic:negation/negation-polarity-items-scope--ka"],"statement":{"en":"In Shizunai, the postposition ka occurs more frequently with negative predicates than positive ones, where it can mark an adjunct as 'not even' or 'not in the least'.","ja":"静内方言において後置詞 ka は肯定述語よりも否定述語とともにより頻繁に生起し、副加語を「〜さえ…ない」「少しも…ない」として標示することがある。"},"type":"frequency","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/shizunai"],"quantifier":"frequently","modality":"assertive","conditions":["negative predicate"]},"forms":["ka"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0166-06","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[{"kind":"refines","claim":"claim:negation/negation-polarity-items-scope--particle-ka-frequent-in-negative-contexts","differs_in":"dialect","note":"Refsing narrows the observation of ka's affinity for negative predicates to the Shizunai dialect and specifies its scalar minimizer interpretation."}],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:negation/negation-polarity-items-scope--ka-can-function-as-a-negative-particle","revision":1,"topic":"topic:negation/negation-polarity-items-scope","topics":["topic:negation/negation-polarity-items-scope","topic:negation/negation-polarity-items-scope--ka"],"statement":{"en":"ka can function as a negative particle.","ja":"ka は否定の助詞として機能する。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":[],"quantifier":"unstated","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["ka"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:sato2008@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0386-01","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
